                <p>Source: Department of State, Conference Files: Lot 62 D 181, CF 833A. Secret.
                    Drafted by Dulles.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d41-f2" n="2" xml:id="d41-f2-content">
                <p>The dinner took place at the Pan American Union. (Eisenhower Library, Dulles
                    Papers, Appointment Book)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
